                <h3>Enterprise Security & Governance</h3>
                <p>Architecting defense-in-depth strategies for customer-facing portals. I design comprehensive API authorization models and cryptographic implementations that ensure compliance without sacrificing user experience.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card reveal stagger-2">
                <h3>System Modernization</h3>
                <p>Leading the evolution of legacy frameworks into cloud-native ecosystems. My focus lies in balancing backward compatibility with forward-looking .NET Core architectures to reduce technical debt.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card reveal stagger-3">
                <h3>Operational Excellence</h3>
                <p>Transforming reactive support into proactive observability. I implement standardized logging and APM strategies to drastically reduce MTTR and enhance system stability.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-card reveal stagger-4">
                <h3>Business Logic Engineering</h3>
                <p>Translating complex financial rules into deterministic software behaviors. I specialize in designing high-integrity workflows for credit management and data correlation.</p>
            </div>
